msgstr "Δ"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Changed, not applied"
msgstr "Módosítva, még nem alkalmazva"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
